{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And I will speak with you from above the cover.</b> As for what is written, 'He spoke to him from the Tent of Meeting' — this is what it says: when Moses was outside the Tent, he would hear the voice coming to him from the Tent of Meeting; and when he was inside the Tent, the voice would come to him from above the cover, as it is written, 'And when Moses came into the Tent of Meeting, he heard the voice,' etc." "<b>All that I command.</b> That is, 'I will speak with you from above the cover' — and I will also speak with you there <b>all that I command you</b>, etc."], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:00:25.909302217Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}